# How speak should say words it gets wrong: one per line, the word, =, then how it sounds.
# Spell it the way you'd spell it out for a friend, with hyphens between the parts so it's said as one word.
# Any capitals match, and a phrase works too. Changes are picked up straight away, even by a book being made.
# Try one: copy a sentence and run  speak -c
